  "system": {
    "description": {
      "value": "<p><sup><strong>Source:</strong> Arcforge Players Compendium</sup></p>\n<p><strong>Prerequisites:</strong> Technomancy sphere, Tinker sphere (at least one (gizmo) talent).</p>\n<p><strong>Benefit:</strong> One gizmo that you create (excluding permanent gizmos) contains a sprite with a permanent duration that cannot be transferred. This sprite replenishes itself after 1 minute if it is dispelled or destroyed. You may change which gizmo is affected by this feat in a process that takes 1 hour.</p>\n<p><strong>Special:</strong> You may take this feat multiple times. Each time, you may select a different gizmo to gain a sprite.</p>\n<hr>\n<p><a href=\"http://spheresofpower.wikidot.com/gizmo-feats#toc21\">Source: Spheres of Power Wiki</a></p>",
